      "quote": "For younger kids and even tweens and teens, consider setting chat to \"friends only\" or turning it off completely."
    },
    {
      "ref": "[D522]",
      "area": "contact",
      "claim": "A parent reports that strangers can request personal details or move chats to other platforms, which are red flags.",
      "stance": "risk",
      "quote": "Explain to your child that if someone asks to chat on another app or platform, or if they request personal details, these are red flags."
    },
    {
      "ref": "[D522]",
      "area": "age_gating",
      "claim": "A parent reports that the under‑13 account setting is required for many safety features to work.",
      "stance": "mitigation",
      "quote": "Ensure that their account is set up as under age 13. Many of the platform's safety features won't work otherwise."
    },
    {
      "ref": "[D522]",
      "area": "money",
      "claim": "A parent reports that tweens may be influenced by peer pressure and in‑game purchases, so spending limits are recommended.",
      "stance": "mitigation",
      "quote": "Review game ratings and set spending limits."
    },
    {
      "ref": "[D522]",
      "area": "content",
      "claim": "A parent reports that cyberbullying can still occur in Roblox chat spaces.",
      "stance": "risk",
      "quote": "Parents should be mindful that cyberbullying can still occur in these spaces, whether it's directed at your child or comes from your child."
    }
  ]
